Either it was a chameleon or some monster hits a polymorph trap. The
chameleon would inherit all properties of the immitating monster, the
chameleons base values will apply if you are magically protected from
shape changers.

If the source was a polymorph trap all you can do is to leave the
level and come back later if you got tough enough. If it was a shape
changer you should evade the minotaur some time until it changes into
weaker monster. The bad thing is that minotauri don't respect
Elbereth, so you really have to flee in both cases in the first place.

